Your fungus reaches into the primordial ages of the world, granting you ancient instincts.

Each time you receive non-regeneration healing you gain [4.3%, 5.7%, 6.9%, 7.8%, 8.7% (TL1-5; MP 100)] of a turn per 100 life healed.  This effect can't add energy past 2 stored turns and overhealing is not counted.

Also, regeneration effects on you will decrease your equilibrium by [1.0, 1.7, 2.2, 2.6, 3.0 (TL1-5)] each turn.

The turn gain increases with your Mindpower.
